{"study_accession":"PRJNA294093","secondary_study_accession":"SRP062910","title":"Transcriptome of human ILC2s; primary vs IL-1b-primed","description":"ILC2s regulate type2 immune responses and protect against helminth infection. We found that ILC2s can be expanded in the presence of a combination of cytokines IL-2 and IL-1b. To better understand the functional and phenotypic consequence of IL-1β activation of ILC2s, we utilized whole transcriptome sequencing (RNA-seq) of freshly isolated ILC2s and IL-1β-primed ILC2s. Differential expression analysis revealed a substantial number of genes underwent significant change between the two conditions (total 4,744 gene, FDR<0.01, Fold change >2), among which 3,871 genes were upregulated in IL-1β –primed ILC2s. Overall design: Six samples were analyzed, three biological replicates of isolated ILC2s and three biological replicates of isolated ILC2s cultured with IL-1b","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN04014701","study_accession":"PRJNA294093","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"freshly isolated ILC2s #1","description":"freshly isolated ILC2s #1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM1862898","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2016-04-26","attributes":[["source_name","peripheral blood"],["donor type","healthy donor"],["tissue","peripheral blood"],["cell_type","innate lymphoid cells (ILC2)"],["culture type","freshly isolated"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR2187598","experiment_accession":"SRX1166216","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":73787825,"base_count":7083631200,"first_public":"2016-04-26","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM1862898: freshly isolated ILC2s #1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN04014702","study_accession":"PRJNA294093","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"fre